21.16 Total Web Solutions (TWS) MEGA PAGE
Displaying Data from Multiple E1 Units on One Webpage
Using the TWS components WebExplorer and WebReacher, you can design a single 
webpage that displays data from multiple meters with E1 Network Options. To accomplish 
this, you should have a basic understanding of TWS, explained earlier in this chapter.
You should modify the Java Script Code on the webpages in use and also make a
change to the Internet Explorer browser setting, as detailed below.
1. Using the default files supplied by the E1 Network Options as templates, modify the 
Java Script code for all webpages using the sample below. This sample portion of Java 
Script code is for demonstration purpose only. You must insert your own code where 
needed.
