2. To enable the MEGA Page on your browser, follow these steps:
a. From Internet Explorer, click Tools > Internet Options > Security.
b. Click the Custom Level button and scroll to the Miscellaneous section.
c. Click the Enable radio button next to "Access data sources across domains" and 
"Navigate subframes across different domains."
d. Click OK twice to close the windows.
